160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/Steps_Obliss\" title=\"Steps Obliss\">Steps Obliss</a></b>, Turn in <a href=\"/page/Item:Seeing_the_Impossible:_Behind_the_Dark_Curtain\" title=\"Item:Seeing the Impossible: Behind the Dark Curtain\">Seeing the Impossible: Behind the Dark Curtain</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/edit/Hidden_Hand_Secret_Visibility?redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Hidden Hand Secret Visibility (page does not exist)\">Hidden Hand Secret Visibility</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/edit/Hidden_Hand_Secret_Visibility?redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Hidden Hand Secret Visibility (page does not exist)\">Hidden Hand Secret Visibility</a>:</b> Allows the wearer to see some things that the Hidden Hand has hidden handily.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Forbidden_Knowledge\" title=\"Named item sets\">Forbidden Knowledge</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Forbidden_Knowledge\" title=\"Named item sets\">Forbidden Knowledge</a>:</b> 3 Pieces Equipped:<br />+10 Profane bonus to PRR<br />4 Pieces Equipped:<br />+1 Profane bonus to all ability scores<br />+1 Profane bonus to attack and damage<br />5 Pieces Equipped:<br />+5 Profane bonus to Melee and Ranged Power<br />+10 Profane bonus to Universal Spell Power<br />+1 Profane bonus to Spell DCs</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Legendary_Forbidden_Knowledge\" title=\"Named item sets\">Legendary Forbidden Knowledge</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Legendary_Forbidden_Knowledge\" title=\"Named item sets\">Legendary Forbidden Knowledge</a>:</b> 3 Pieces Equipped:<br />+30 Profane bonus to PRR<br />4 Pieces Equipped:<br />+3 Profane bonus to all ability scores<br />+4 Profane bonus to attack and damage<br />5 Pieces Equipped:<br />+15 Profane bonus to Melee and Ranged Power<br />+25 Profane bonus to Universal Spell Power<br />+3 Profane bonus to Spell DCs</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Steps%27_Lenses_of_Seein%27_Hidden_Hand_Secrets.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Steps%27_Lenses_of_Seein%27_Hidden_Hand_Secrets.png/420px-Steps%27_Lenses_of_Seein%27_Hidden_Hand_Secrets.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"498\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Steps%27_Lenses_of_Seein%27_Hidden_Hand_Secrets.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li>\n<li>Given by <a href=\"/page/Steps_Obliss\" title=\"Steps Obliss\">Steps Obliss</a> once a day, after talking to to her for 13 days in total and fetching Seeing the Impossible: Behind the Dark Curtain from <a href=\"/page/Turn_the_Page_(quest)\" title=\"Turn the Page (quest)\">Turn the Page (quest)</a>.</li></ul>\n<p>This item, when equipped, allows you to see hidden chests in certain quests related to the <a href=\"/page/Vecna\" title=\"Vecna\">Vecna</a> storyline (<a href=\"/page/The_Hand_and_the_Eyes\" title=\"The Hand and the Eyes\">The Hand and the Eyes</a> in <a href=\"/page/Grip_of_the_Hidden_Hand\" title=\"Grip of the Hidden Hand\">Grip of the Hidden Hand</a>, and <a href=\"/page/The_Evil_We_Know\" title=\"The Evil We Know\">The Evil We Know</a>, <a href=\"/page/Taken_in_Hand\" title=\"Taken in Hand\">Taken in Hand</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Vecna_Denied\" title=\"Vecna Denied\">Vecna Denied</a> in <a href=\"/page/Vecna_Unleashed\" title=\"Vecna Unleashed\">Vecna Unleashed</a>) which contain <a href=\"/page/Dust_of_Vile_Darkness\" title=\"Dust of Vile Darkness\">Dust of Vile Darkness</a>, a type crafting ingredient used at the <a href=\"/page/Esoteric_Table\" title=\"Esoteric Table\">Esoteric Table</a> and <a href=\"/page/Unholy_Defiler_of_the_Hidden_Hand\" title=\"Unholy Defiler of the Hidden Hand\">Unholy Defiler of the Hidden Hand</a>.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817230555\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.078 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.121 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3860/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27443/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10433/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 32/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 13/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n124.53%  128.917     48 Template:IO\n100.00%  103.520      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  103.520      1 -total\n 95.64%   99.005      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 41.36%   42.813      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 40.46%   41.882      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 39.59%   40.988      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 38.72%   40.084      2 Template:InCategory\n 18.85%   19.509      5 Template:Popup\n 16.67%   17.254      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:104912-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817230555 and revision id 635051. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
  "wikitext": "{{Named item|Jewelry\n  | name                     = Steps' Lenses of Seein' Hidden Hand Secrets\n  | minlevel                 = 1\n  | type                     = Goggles\n  | slot                     = Eye\n  | bind                     = {{Bind|BtA|BoA}}\n  | durability               = 110\n  | material                 = Steel\n  | hardness                 = 21\n  | cost                     = 401 pp\n  | weight                   = 0.10 lbs\n  | released                 = Update 61\n  | quest                    = Steps Obliss\n  | end reward               = \n  | turn in                  = {{Item|Seeing the Impossible: Behind the Dark Curtain}}\n  | chest                    = \n  | mythic                   = no\n  | enhancements             = \n* {{Hidden Hand Secret Visibility}}\n* {{Named item sets|Forbidden Knowledge}}\n* {{Named item sets|Legendary Forbidden Knowledge}}\n  | food                     = no\n  | crafting                 = \n  | description              = \n  | pic                      = Steps' Lenses of Seein' Hidden Hand Secrets shown.jpg\n  | picdesc                  = Steps' Lenses of Seein' Hidden Hand Secrets.png\n  | tips                     = \n Given by [[Steps Obliss]] once a day, after talking to to her for 13 days in total and fetching Seeing the Impossible: Behind the Dark Curtain from [[Turn the Page (quest)]].\n\nThis item, when equipped, allows you to see hidden chests in certain quests related to the [[Vecna]] storyline ([[The Hand and the Eyes]] in [[Grip of the Hidden Hand]], and [[The Evil We Know]], [[Taken in Hand]], and [[Vecna Denied]] in [[Vecna Unleashed]]) which contain [[Dust of Vile Darkness]], a type crafting ingredient used at the [[Esoteric Table]] and [[Unholy Defiler of the Hidden Hand]].\n}}",
